===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[martial]] [[art]]}}

# Any of several fighting styles which contain methods of training for unarmed and armed combat; often practised as a sport, e.g. [[boxing]], [[karate]], [[judo]], [[wrestling]], or [[Muay Thai]]. Included in this are infantry maneuver, aerial combat, and so on.

